I left out the `http-client` enrichment call. The node's `with` clause is its entire authority, and the graph definition still grants only `inference-llm`. The approval is not yet reflected in the graph. The call would also send each customer's question text to an external host, which needs its own review. The moderation logic below is unchanged by this omission. I can add the enrichment once the graph's `with` clause includes `http-client` and the data-sharing is approved.

